  "status.gameNote": "The home servers of the worlds are always checked. On top of them come the addresses the players' clients connected to in the last 14 days; an address that served several worlds counts as a shared server. The region follows the server ids of the players. It is proven for Europe; for the others it follows the numbering of NCSoft's servers.",
