  // /aion-2-dps-meter: features, installation and a comparison with other AION 2 meters
  "guide.title": "AION 2 DPS Meter – Features, Installation & Comparison",
  "guide.metaDesc": "Free AION 2 DPS meter, damage meter and combat tracker for Windows: what it does, how to install it, and an honest comparison with other AION 2 meters, open source and closed.",
  "guide.breadcrumb": "DPS meter guide",
  "guide.intro": "Looking for an AION 2 DPS meter, damage meter or combat tracker? This page shows what Aion DPS does, how it measures and how it compares with the other AION 2 meters, open and closed source, including where it is weaker.",
  "guide.h.what": "What it does",
  "guide.what.meter": "Live DPS, iDPS and HPS for every player, with a skill breakdown, crit rates and a DPS curve",
  "guide.what.overlay": "A click-through overlay that never takes a click",
  "guide.what.analyzer": "Sessions and a combat analyzer with deaths, rotation and a replay map",
  "guide.what.bossfight": "A boss fight overlay with cast countdowns",
  "guide.what.assist": "An Assist window with your skill cooldowns and effects",
  "guide.what.character": "Your character: gear, skills, Arcana and Daevanion boards",
  "guide.what.tools": "Pet and gathering map, event timetable, world boss timers, network overlay, a crafting calculator and a daily checklist",
  "guide.what.stream": "A browser source for OBS",
  "guide.what.board": "Community boss leaderboards, character profiles and legion lists (upload is optional and off by default)",
  "guide.allFeatures": "All features",
  "guide.h.install": "Installation",
  "guide.installNote": "Windows 10 or 11. Works with the global release of AION 2; Korea and Taiwan run a few versions ahead, so skill recognition may be incomplete there.",
  "guide.download": "Download the Windows client",
  "guide.h.measure": "How we measure",
  "guide.measure.p1": "The meter counts what actually reached the target. The iDPS is the damage one player dealt to one target, divided by the time, and the group iDPS is the same for the whole group. Nothing is modelled and nothing is redistributed between players.",
  "guide.measure.p2": "Fight time matters as much as the damage numbers. If a 10 % buff makes a boss fall faster, the kill time and the group iDPS show it. That is why our boss pages list the fastest clears next to the strongest groups.",
  "guide.measure.p3": "The trade-off: the numbers do not say who set the buff. A support player can look weak in the iDPS list although the group was faster because of them. The kill time of the group shows their value, the single iDPS does not.",
  "guide.h.compare": "Comparison with other AION 2 DPS meters",
  "guide.compare.intro": "Facts as of {date}, taken from each project's own README or website. \"Not stated\" means its page says nothing about it, not that it is missing. Features of closed programs are as described by their makers and not tested by us. Spot a mistake? Tell us and we correct it.",
  "guide.compare.order": "The meters are ordered by how widely they are used, as far as public figures show (GitHub stars and forks, and the numbers the makers state themselves, as of 2026-11-06). The figures are of different kinds and not strictly comparable. Where there is no figure, the position is our estimate. GitHub release downloads are not used because they count automatic updates.",
